{"id":"H4318","lemma":"מִיכָה","transliteration":"mikhah","sayIt":"mi-KHAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Micah","meaning":"A man living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at Jdg.17.1\nAlso named: mi.kha.ye.hu (מִיכָֽיְהוּ \"Micah\" H4321I)\n§ Micah or Micaiah or Michah = \"who is like God\"\n1) the 6th in order of the minor prophets; a native of Moresheth, he prophesied during the reigns of Jotham, Ahaz, and Hezekiah of Judah, and was contemporary with the prophets Hosea, Amos, and Isaiah\n2) an Ephraimite during the period of the judges\n3) a descendant of Joel the Reubenite\n4) son of Meribbaal and grandson of Jonathan\n5) a Kohathite Levite, the eldest son of Uzziel the brother of Amram\n6) father of Abdon, a man of high station in the reign of Josiah\n7) son of Imlah and a prophet of Samaria who predicted the defeat and death of king Ahab of Israel","glosses":["micah","micah’s","then micah","micah has","because he","micaiah"],"count":30,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"jdg-17","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah","kjv":"Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-17","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah’s","kjv":"of Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-17","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah","kjv":"And Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-17","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah","kjv":"And Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-17","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah","kjv":"And Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-17","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Micah","kjv":"Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Micah","kjv":"of Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah’s","kjv":"of Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah has","kjv":"Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah’s"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Micah","kjv":"of Micah"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Micah’s","kjv":"into Micah's"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Micah’s","kjv":"of Micah"}},{"chapterId"